   ],
   "source": [
    "V1,W1,b1,a1 = train(X,lambd=0)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We observe that the reconstruction term decreases strongly, indicating that the autoencoder becomes increasingly better at reconstructing the data. The sparsity term, however, increases, indicating that the standard autoencoder does not learn a sparse representation.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Sparse Autoencoder\n",
    "\n",
    "We now would like to train a sparse autoencoder. For this, we set the sparsity parameter to $\\lambda=1$ and re-run the training procedure. We store the learned parameters in another set of variables."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
